// ---- zfGlyph: the soft font, codes 33-126 -----------------------
// Five words a glyph: its 14 sixels, three to a word from the top six
// bits down -- the 7 of the upper band (rows 1-6, top row the low bit),
// then the 7 of the lower band (rows 7-10) -- and a last slot of 0.
// Drawn from the Standard's 8x8 glyphs (S16): each source column
// to its nearest of 7 (the two center columns become one); the top and
